+## VERDICT AND KEY RISKS
+
+**Verdict:** An excellent branded-consumer franchise — wide distribution moat, ~32% ROCE, clean cash conversion, net cash — but the price already embeds ~18% FCF growth for a decade [reverse-DCF, valuation.py], which the company has not sustained. Quality high; margin of safety thin. **Confidence: high on business quality, low on the entry price being attractive.**
