+
+**Disqualifying gates: checked, none tripped.** Clean audit opinion, no promoter pledge, no related-party leakage, no auditor/CFO churn [FY26 AR, Auditor's Report & Note 34]. The score's drag is valuation, not quality or integrity.
+
+**The three things that matter most:**
+1. **Distribution moat is widening.** Direct reach 1.35 m outlets, up from 0.9 m in FY22 [FY26 investor presentation, slide 9]; this is the durable asset, not any single brand.
+2. **Returns are high and cash-backed.** ROCE 32% [computed: EBIT 820 / capital employed 2,550, FY26 AR] with CFO/EBITDA of 88% [computed: CFO 806 / EBITDA 916, FY26 AR] — profit converts to cash.
