+---
+
+## 2. Sector Classification and Playbook
+
+**Sub-sector:** Branded packaged foods (FMCG). **Playbook:** `references/sectors/fmcg-consumer.md`.
+
+**Why:** an annuity-like, brand-and-distribution business; the right lens is volume growth, gross/EBITDA margin, ROCE, working-capital cycle and reinvestment — not the metrics that suit asset-heavy or financial businesses.
+
