+## 8. Red Flags and Governance
+
+**No material red flags identified.** Checked and clear: clean unqualified audit opinion [FY26 AR, Auditor's Report]; no CARO qualifications [FY26 AR, CARO annexure]; no promoter pledge, promoter holding stable at 48% [shareholding pattern, Jun-2026]; related-party transactions immaterial and arm's-length [FY26 AR, Note 34]; promoter remuneration ~2% of PAT; no auditor or CFO change in five years; contingent liabilities ~4% of net worth.
